From 4daf78fb1a86670973f18e3d8d32ee3877cf2e7a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Richard E Barber <kd6kxr@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 9 Sep 2026 01:11:56 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] Add framing annotations with proportional sans serif text

Integrate the annotation feature from RawTherapee PR #7405 with current dev. Embed antialiased Annotation Sans Regular glyphs with proportional advances and pair kerning, keep measurement and drawing consistent, and clip text safely to the bottom border.

Include annotation profile persistence and batch edit tracking, font source and licensing, a reproducible generator, and renderer regression checks.

Validation: application and CLI builds; address/undefined sanitizer renderer checks; light, dark, long, thin, and minimum-border exports; profile round trips, partial profiles, and batch parameter checks.
